# Pairs with NoStaleAuthority. The advance stops waiting for an unacknowledged
# silo at the recorded deadline rather than at the deadline plus the margin, so
# it completes while a slower silo still trusts the lease.
MODULE: LeaseAgesLapsesCaptureAtDeadline
TARGET: NoStaleAuthority
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a captured lease stops holding the advance at its recorded deadline
PERTURBS: LeaseAges

--- FIND
                IF pend[t] = "tied" /\ next = "none" THEN "lapsed" ELSE pend[t]]
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the margin is not waited out.
                IF pend[t] = "tied" THEN "lapsed" ELSE pend[t]]
--- END
